# AAFE Skill Index On-Demand Router

For every task in this repository:
1. Read `.ai-agent/skill-index.md` first.
2. If present, read `.ai-agent/project.md` for project-specific quick map and domain routing hints.
3. Only when the task matches a domain, read the matching `.ai-agent/project-skills/<domain>/SKILL.md`.
4. For non-trivial frontend work, then follow `.ai-agent/runtime/*` and `.ai-agent/pipelines/*`.
5. Editor directories are pointers only. Do not copy, rewrite, or maintain project knowledge in `.cursor`.
6. Do not eagerly read all project skills.
7. `aafe` is runnable from this repo (`node_modules/.bin/aafe` when not on `PATH`). See the
   "Commands you may run yourself" table in `.ai-agent/skill-index.md` and run them yourself
   instead of asking the user to. Prefer `aafe knowledge search` over a blind grep when locating code.
